# Byte-faithful checkouts: the digests in revision/RELEASE_MANIFEST.json and the
# source hashes recorded in revision/paper/figure_data/plotted_values.json are
# computed over the exact bytes committed here, so git must not translate line
# endings at all.
* -text
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.npz binary
*.pt binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.pkl binary
